name: test_classifier

nodes:
  - name: chunks
    type: Split
    split_unit: sentences
    chunk_size: 3

  - name: classify
    type: Classifier
    model_names:
      - gpt-4o-mini
      - openai/gpt-4o-mini
    agreement_fields:
      - topic
      - sentiment
    inputs:
      - chunks

---#chunks
{{input}}

---#classify

Read the text and classify it:

<text>
{{input}}
</text>

What is the main topic? [[pick:topic|coffee,economics,politics,lifestyle,other]]

What is the overall sentiment? [[pick:sentiment|positive,negative,neutral]]
